Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.06,0:00:05.76,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Even PriPara pizza is capisce!{capiscally delicious!}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:09.88,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,Curry udon is devilishly delightful. {guilty pleasure}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:12.27,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,A healthy appetite!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:14.34,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Candy daifuku...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:16.38,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Another!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:17.97,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Parfait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.22,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pushuu~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:21.80,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Monja.{its a more liquid okonomiyaki, they used the actual word okonomiyaki before, but now she says monja, so maybe a TL note explaining it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:23.85,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Strawberry shortcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.29,0:00:25.48,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:29.84,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,PriPara Café sure does have a well-rounded{varied} menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:31.68,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,All right, don't just stuff your faces;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:34.24,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,focus your attention on cute little me-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:37.01,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Focus on my beautiful looks-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:38.49,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Anyway, we have something...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:43.20,PriPara,Neko,0,0,0,,...important to talk about with all of you-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:43.20,PriPara-Alt,All,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:47.45,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Tada!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:51.38,PriPara,Neko,0,0,0,,They've put together the\N Summer Dream Idol Grand Prix's schedule.{ has been decided on.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:54.09,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,Summer Dream Idol Grand Prix?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.53,0:02:27.05,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,This is my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:30.64,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Grand...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:31.61,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:32.44,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:38.18,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,It's a tournament where a number of five-person teams battle each other {on stage }in order to win. {essentally a battle of the bands, but shows... so ya, almost same thing}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.18,0:02:41.90,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,That is the Dream Idol Grand Prix-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:45.37,PriPara,Neko,0,0,0,,The first round takes place this summer-nekon.{opens in the summer-nekon.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:46.12,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:49.83,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A hot show for a hot summer-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:53.92,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,So the next thing is to come up with a better team name-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.53,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Golden opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:03:00.24,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,We, too, will {\i1}Go{\i0} get fired up so we don't lag behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:01.30,PriPara,Dorna,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.06,0:03:04.04,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's join this match together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:08.11,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,AromageDressing Pafé sounds nice too-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.11,0:03:10.10,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It should be Dressiromageddon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.10,0:03:11.52,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Kinda tough to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:14.94,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kumama! Don't make your decision so hastily-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.35,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:20.48,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,The team who wins the GrandPrix will be given the SDPC-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:23.43,PriPara,Dorna,0,0,0,,The SDPC!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.43,0:03:24.79,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,So, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:28.36,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,The SDPC, also known as...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.36,0:03:31.41,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,...the Summer Dream Parade Coord-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:35.37,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'm still lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:41.38,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,The ladies who wear it become the Princesses of Summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:43.09,PriPara,Lala,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:44.64,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,When you say summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:48.30,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,does that mean there are also autumn and winter ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.59,0:03:51.26,PriPara,Neko,0,0,0,,You sure are perceptive-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:55.49,PriPara,Neko,0,0,0,,Once the Princesses of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter have been chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:59.23,PriPara,Neko,0,0,0,,the Princess of Seasons will be chosen when the Coord of Seasons appears.
