Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:05.60,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:09.16,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'll be the Demon Princess of Summer if I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.78,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Pudding is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:12.16,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now then, girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:14.07,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Put everything you've got into it-usa!
