Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:20.33,PriPara,Usa,0,0,0,,My Dressing Pafé will be taking the lead this time-usa.{be ahead this time-usa.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:23.42,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,No way you'll be able to win\Nagainst a cool bear like me-kuma!
