Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:27.51,PriPara,Usa,0,0,0,,If it's cool you're looking for, I win-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:30.17,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm way above cool-kuma!
