Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.03,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:44.15,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,My little sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.15,0:04:46.11,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:50.04,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,That's right, she calls me "Big bro"...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.04,0:04:50.82,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:53.33,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:59.08,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kumama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:02.70,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Are you okay, cute young lass?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:04.30,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.23,0:05:06.84,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:08.63,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.63,0:05:11.17,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.07,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Big bro! Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.33,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,It's been so long-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:20.70,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,I missed you-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:23.56,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,My cute little sister,{ imouto} Usacha!
