Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.89,0:05:27.59,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,They look nothing like each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:29.75,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.75,0:05:31.27,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,What a broad smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:34.28,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,So that's what Usagi looks like when he smiles...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.61,0:05:35.69,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.69,0:05:36.74,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:38.45,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Little sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:42.60,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha, what happened to mascot school-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.60,0:05:45.21,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Mascots don't do well in humidity-ucha,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:47.79,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,so school's out for the rainy season-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:49.46,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,That makes sense-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:51.68,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,School... That brings back memories-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.89,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,You were an honor roll student, after all-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:56.03,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,That's not worth mentioning-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:57.72,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,So why are you here, Usacha?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:04.94,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,I came to see my cool, elite, beautiful,\Nand beloved big bro-ucha!{my heart hngggg}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:08.12,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usacha, you truly are an adorable little sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:11.68,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,All right, go ahead and introduce yourself to everyone-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:22.98,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,SoWaMi Smile, Dwessing Pawfé, Awomageddon, Neko,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:25.34,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,nice to meetcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:27.63,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,I'm Usagi's little sister, Usacha-ucha!{>_>}{83}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.20,0:06:30.34,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,She's adorable!{2 exclamation marks too much?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.55,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:37.26,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,And 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2.
