Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:43.94,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I wasn't late; Sion was just early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:45.73,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Less complaining, more dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:49.88,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Do you think you'll be able to beat SoLaMi Smile like that-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:51.32,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Once more from the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:54.53,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,And 1, 2, 1, 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:56.93,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What's gotten into Usagi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.53,0:07:02.46,PriPara-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.93,0:06:58.49,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,He's more fired up than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:02.46,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,As the older brother, he wants to show his little sister his good points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:04.83,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What a hopeless idiot... {can't help it}
