Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:08.63,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:10.35,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,You answer with a "Yes, sir"-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.17,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Yes, sir-usa.
