Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.55,0:07:14.63,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Big bro is so cool-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:20.35,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,After that, handling the schedule \Nis also an important job of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.64,0:07:23.92,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,When it comes to your big bro, \Ninstead of having it down to the minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:26.96,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,I've got the schedule memorized down to the second-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.75,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,This'll be a great experience{ for Usacha}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:32.61,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Usacha wants to become an Elite Manager \Njust like you, big bro-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:33.82,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Is that so-usa?
