Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:46.31,PriPara,Neko,0,0,0,,Is this where it itches?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:49.46,PriPara,Neko,0,0,0,,Want me to use my nails this time-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:51.21,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Yes! There, right there!
