Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:06.52,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course{you're right}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:09.24,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,I'm so jeal... Err, it {\i1}is{\i0} uncool-usa.
