Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:32.92,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.95,0:08:37.22,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Big bro is really cool-ucha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:39.64,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,I want to be just like him-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:44.05,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Wow! Nekonee was incredible-kuma! {orgasmic = too lewd?}
