Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:52.36,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for my Elite Manager big bro\N to finish up with his work-ucha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:54.28,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Work-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:57.24,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Ah!{oh god why}
