Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:21.18,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,It's pretty normal to run a little late in that scenario{ with their entry}-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:23.68,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Even then, you shouldn't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.68,0:09:26.39,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,Please let them-usa. I'm begging you-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:29.34,PriPara-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Please-usa! Please-usa! Usa! Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:31.07,PriPara,Usacha,0,0,0,,Is this the good thing-ucha?
