Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.81,0:09:38.06,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,I won't forgive Usagi for being the only one \Nwith such a cute little sister-kuma!{It's unforgivable that only Usagi has such a cute little sister-kuma.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:41.45,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Now your little sister will see who{how} you really are-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:44.58,PriPara2,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I can't break the system's rules.{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:46.03,PriPara2,Usagi,0,0,0,,Please-usa!{bg}
