Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.29,0:09:51.24,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,It means your body is dripping with sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:53.68,PriPara,Usagi,0,0,0,,If you don't {properly }wipe it off, you'll catch a cold-usa.
